    {
      "id": "8227ed1a-62fd-4e3c-b8d9-8c79e15daa4b",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 700,
        "content": "## Text back missed calls (Twilio)\n**Who it's for:** trades and local service businesses that miss calls while on the job.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Twilio calls the *missed-call webhook* when a call ends unanswered (`no-answer`, `busy`, `failed`, `canceled`).\n2. The caller gets an SMS from your business with your booking link.\n3. You get an SMS alert with the caller's number.\n4. Replies are forwarded to you. STOP/ARRET opts the caller out; START opts back in.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Add a Twilio credential to the three Twilio nodes.\n2. Fill in both **Settings** nodes (business name, numbers in E.164, booking link).\n3. Twilio number \u2192 Voice: `<Dial>` your real phone with `action` = the missed-call **production** URL. Messaging webhook = the incoming-SMS URL.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Requirements:** Twilio account and number (paid). n8n Cloud or self-hosted.\n**Customise:** edit the SMS text in *Text the caller back*. Keep the business name and STOP line."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "89dec275-318d-4cf7-ba42-b26c482cd43b",
      "name": "Sticky Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        400,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 120,
        "content": "**Missed-call branch:** decides if the call was really missed and the caller hasn't opted out, then texts the caller and alerts you. Twilio always gets an empty TwiML reply."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f11e5ce0-fa58-43fc-9e84-b1a9901c0a10",
      "name": "Sticky Note 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        400,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 120,
        "content": "**Incoming SMS branch:** keeps the opt-out list (stored in this workflow's static data) and forwards real replies to you. Leave Twilio's Advanced Opt-Out ON as a second layer."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
